[{"id":168927431,"discussion_id":"12fabc35c82a02364ed982d91e0193a8e647486a","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| attention | ✅ [*jiang-lirui*](https://gitcode.com/jiang-lirui), [*黄俊健*](https://gitcode.com/monologue815) (2/2) | ✅ [*jiang-lirui*](https://gitcode.com/jiang-lirui) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n jiangyu741, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-04-21T10:18:17+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-24T10:42:29+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168927675,"discussion_id":"25f7afb2ebb38736e1a3f2ef11ad7b1199f8af73","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复注意力机制内核中，当稀疏模式为TREE时，在特定注意力掩码布局（TND/NTD）下判断是否跳过注意力掩码计算的逻辑错误。该问题可能导致在需要应用注意力掩码的场景下错误地跳过掩码操作，从而影响模型计算结果的正确性和推理准确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改了`ElewiseCompute`函数中调用`fa_base_vector::IsSkipAttentionmask`函数的逻辑。将原先未指定模板参数的调用，更正为显式传递模板参数`<true>`，以确保在TREE稀疏模式和布尔类型掩码的场景下，函数能够被正确实例化并做出准确判断，从而保证注意力掩码的拷贝和计算逻辑得以正确执行。","created_at":"2026-04-21T10:19:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-21T10:19:09+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":169219457,"discussion_id":"3eef58c51f73763847fbcf82f963a457fc040ace","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-04-23T11:15:03+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-23T11:15:03+08:00","user":{"id":"68b936d944103821480b821c","login":"jiangyu741","object_id":"68b936d944103821480b821c","name":"jiangyu741","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/jiangyu741"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":169219802,"discussion_id":"3123a5b003167496e7ce5884279cd370d7edc124","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=4cc3f37cbe0446eebcc20897ffca2d43&projectName=CANN'>4cc3f37cbe0446eebcc20897ffca2d43</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=4cc3f37cbe0446eebcc20897ffca2d43&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-transformer/package/4433/cann-ops-transformer-experimental_linux-x86_64.run>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>